997
00:51:37,867 --> 00:51:39,633
悄悄告诉你们个小秘密，
I'll let you into
a little secret,

998
00:51:39,667 --> 00:51:44,400
前面开那台法拉利的人，
the man in front of me,
the man driving that Ferrari

999
00:51:44,433 --> 00:51:48,100
可是法拉利F1车队的试车手——卢卡·巴多尔。
is the F1 team's test driver,
Luca Badoer.

1000
00:51:50,533 --> 00:51:52,167
而我居然紧紧咬住了他。
And I'm keeping up with him.

1001
00:51:52,200 --> 00:51:55,533
我可不是吹牛，
但他休想甩掉我。
And I'm not bragging
or anything but he is not
getting away.

1002
00:51:58,233 --> 00:52:02,233
我也打滑了……
噢没翻，救回来了！
太棒了！我超过去啦！
I'm spinning as well...
Oh, no, I've held it.
Yes! I've passed him!

1003
00:52:03,467 --> 00:52:06,067
吃我的尾气去吧，巴多尔！
Eat my exhaust, Badoer!

1004
00:52:08,300 --> 00:52:12,767
看到这儿你们大概在想，
这两辆车本质上差不多嘛。
So you're probably thinking
at this point that these cars
are basically the same.

1005
00:52:12,800 --> 00:52:18,233
两台都是在极速超跑的基础上，
做减重和特调出来的性能怪物。
Both are lightened
and fettled versions
of already very fast cars.

1006
00:52:18,267 --> 00:52:21,900
性能都丧心病狂，
快得惊天动地，
Both have mental performance,
monumental performance,

1007
00:52:21,933 --> 00:52:26,100
而且要是开上普通公路，
都会吵得要死、颠得要命。
and both would be too noisy
and too hard on the road.

1008
00:52:27,833 --> 00:52:33,633
但实际上，
它俩根本风马牛不相及，
差得就像白垩土和鸡肝酱！
But actually,
they're as different as chalk
and chicken liver pate!

1009
00:52:33,667 --> 00:52:37,567
保时捷极其朴素纯粹，
非常简单直接。
The Porsche is very plain,
very simple.

1010
00:52:37,600 --> 00:52:39,267
就像一盘蔬菜沙拉。
It's like a green salad.

1011
00:52:40,300 --> 00:52:42,067
但换到这一台呢，
Now this,
on the other hand,

1012
00:52:42,100 --> 00:52:44,633
它更像一道
芥末飞鱼刺身。
is more like
a flying fish wasabi.

1013
00:52:44,667 --> 00:52:47,100
要复杂精细得多得多。
It's much,
much more complicated.

1014
00:52:48,500 --> 00:52:52,100
配了换挡拨片，
我虽然还是讨厌拨片，
You have a flappy
paddle gearbox,
I still don't like it.

1015
00:52:52,133 --> 00:52:55,833
但至少在赛道上
它确实管用。
But it does at least
work on the track.

1016
00:52:55,867 --> 00:53:00,367
还有保时捷上完全没有的
牵引力控制系统。
And you have a traction
control system that
