1025
00:53:36,400 --> 00:53:39,300
（咆哮怒吼）
直接起飞！
(VOCALISING)
You're off again!

1026
00:53:40,500 --> 00:53:43,067
当你坐进这个座舱里，
And because you're sitting
here in a cockpit

1027
00:53:43,067 --> 00:53:49,167
面对着裸露的碳纤维，没有地毯，
握着翻毛皮方向盘，
with this bare carbon fibre,
and no carpets and a suede
steering wheel

1028
00:53:49,200 --> 00:53:54,400
绑着全套赛车安全带，
