“老子这就是在开纯正赛车！”
and a full race harness,
you really do think,
"I am in a racing car!"

1029
00:53:56,500 --> 00:54:00,467
刹车脚感像赛车。
我提过它的转向手感吗？
我刚才说了吗？
It brakes like a racing car.
Have I mentioned the steering?
Have I mentioned that?

1030
00:54:03,433 --> 00:54:08,067
无懈可击。
找不出别的词了，完美无瑕。
It's perfect.
There is no other word,
it's perfect.

1031
00:54:10,067 --> 00:54:13,067
毫无疑问，这是一台伟大的车。
This then, is a great car.

1032
00:54:13,067 --> 00:54:17,367
但它比911更好吗？
But is it better than the 911?

1033
00:54:17,400 --> 00:54:21,700
照常理说，比起电子工程，
我更青睐纯粹的机械工程。
Normally, I prefer
mechanical engineering
to electrical engineering.

1034
00:54:21,733 --> 00:54:24,867
比起奔腾处理器，我更喜欢钢架大桥。
I prefer a bridge
to a Pentium processor.

1035
00:54:24,900 --> 00:54:27,067
所以按理说我该更喜欢这台，
So I should prefer this.

1036
00:54:27,100 --> 00:54:28,800
更喜欢保时捷才对。
I should prefer the Porsche.

1037
00:54:30,200 --> 00:54:34,433
然而今天坐在这儿，我变心了。
And yet here today, I don't.

1038
00:54:36,100 --> 00:54:41,700
如果你想去赛道找乐子，
买保时捷准没错。
If you want to go to a track
and be entertained,
buy the Porsche.

1039
00:54:41,733 --> 00:54:43,933
那是一台非常、非常出色的车。
It's a very, very good car.

1040
00:54:46,600 --> 00:54:50,567
但如果你想要那种直击灵魂的震撼，
你必须买眼前这台。
But if you want to be
astonished you've got
to have one of these.

1041
00:54:50,600 --> 00:54:52,233
（轮胎尖叫声）
(TYRES SCREECHING)

1042
00:54:57,200 --> 00:54:59,233
-知道了，我懂。
-一英镑。
-Yes. Yes, I know.
-£1.

1043
00:54:59,267 --> 00:55:03,167
行吧，反正说到价格，
你说过为了做这次对比测试，
Well, anyway, on the subject
of price, you said that for
the purposes of that test

1044
00:55:03,200 --> 00:55:05,867
你不会把价格因素考虑在内。
you would take price
out of the equation.

1045
00:55:05,900 --> 00:55:06,933
-对吧？
-对啊。
-Yeah?
-Yeah.

1046
00:55:06,967 --> 00:55:09,333
那我能再把它加回来吗？
Can I just pop it
back in again?

1047
00:55:09,367 --> 00:55:14,200
因为那台法拉利
足足比保时捷贵了五万英镑！
Because that Ferrari
is £50,000 more
than the Porsche.

1048
00:55:15,067 --> 00:55:16,800
-说得有理，讲得很对。
-是吧。
-Fair point, well made.
-Yeah.

1049
00:55:16,833 --> 00:55:20,067
但我还是坚持我的选择，
开起来更刺激的绝对是它——法拉利。
I'll stand by my decision,
this is the more exciting car,
the Ferrari.

1050
00:55:20,067 --> 00:55:24,133
不过我承认，
由于保时捷的表现跟它如此旗鼓相当，
But I will agree,
that because the performance
of the Porsche is so similar

1051
00:55:24,167 --> 00:55:27,333
你不得不……
这性价比简直绝了，真的。
you have to...
It's remarkable value
for money, really is.

1052
00:55:27,367 --> 00:55:29,067
-这就是Top Gear对这两台车的结论。
-没错。
-So that's the Top Gear
verdict on these two.
-Yes.

1053
00:55:29,067 --> 00:55:31,500
那我们现在要看的就是
它们在Top Gear赛道上的圈速了。
What we need now on them
is the Top Gear lap times.

1054
00:55:31,533 --> 00:55:34,400
当然，
现在眼前是一台意大利车和一台德国车。
Absolutely,
we've got an Italian car
and a German car.

1055
00:55:34,433 --> 00:55:38,767
所以我们现在最需要的，
是一位大公无私的英国裁判。
So what we really need
now is a fair-minded
English umpire.

1056
00:55:38,800 --> 00:55:41,067
有请斯提格鸟人出场！
Bring him out, Stiggy Bird.

1057
00:55:42,933 --> 00:55:44,900
克拉克森：
弹射起步，轮胎疯狂打滑。
CLARKSON:
Off the line there,
plenty of wheel spin.

1058
00:55:44,933 --> 00:55:49,067
显然，法拉利切进了竞赛模式，
这会让悬挂变硬、
Naturally, the Ferrari
is in race mode which
firms up the suspension,

1059
00:55:49,067 --> 00:55:52,067
换挡更快，
并且弱化牵引力控制系统。
speeds up the gear changes,
and backs off
the traction control.

1060
00:55:52,067 --> 00:55:55,233
当然了，开车的可是斯提格，
他早就把牵引力控制彻底关掉了。
Except this is the Stig
of course, and he's got
that turned off.

1061
00:55:55,267 --> 00:55:57,500
（车载音响正放着重金属摇滚）
(HEAVY METAL MUSIC PLAYING
