1062
00:55:58,667 --> 00:56:01,067
遗憾的是，他忘了把音响给关了！
Sadly, he hasn't got
the stereo turned off!

1063
00:56:01,067 --> 00:56:02,867
呃……
Um...

1064
00:56:02,900 --> 00:56:06,633
没错，这台车可比方向盘后面的那个家伙
聪明多了。
Yes, this car is a lot more
intelligent than the man
behind the wheel.

1065
00:56:06,667 --> 00:56:08,367
不过目前看起来势头相当不错……
Looking good so far though...

1066
00:56:08,400 --> 00:56:11,700
进入“锤头弯”，
看看有没有推头。
Into Hammerhead,
any under-steer,
let's have a look.

1067
00:56:11,733 --> 00:56:14,733
完全没有，丝毫不推。
Absolutely none at all.

1068
00:56:14,767 --> 00:56:16,200
（音乐继续）
(MUSIC CONTINUES)

1069
00:56:18,167 --> 00:56:20,067
进入“穿心弯”……
Into the Follow Through...

1070
00:56:21,600 --> 00:56:24,333
噢，他收油了，
法拉利车身瞬间不安分地扭了一下！
Oh, he lifted off,
the Ferrari got
all twitchy there!

1071
00:56:24,367 --> 00:56:26,300
虽然它塞满了各种高科技行车电脑，
It may be packed with
computing power

1072
00:56:26,333 --> 00:56:30,100
但骨子里这台360依然是一匹咆哮的烈马。
but that 360 is still
a snorting stallion at heart.

1073
00:56:30,133 --> 00:56:32,533
那是倒数第二个弯，
也是最难啃的一个。
That's the
second-to-last bend,
that's the hard one.

1074
00:56:32,567 --> 00:56:34,967
切入甘邦弯，冲啊！
Into Gambon corner, come on!

1075
00:56:35,067 --> 00:56:37,733
加油，冲啊！
冲过终点线，成绩是……
Come on, come on
and across the line in...

1076
00:56:37,767 --> 00:56:39,600
怎么了，念啊？
Yes, go on?

1077
00:56:39,633 --> 00:56:41,133
行吧，你看，成绩板在这儿。
Okay, look,
here's the lap board.

1078
00:56:41,167 --> 00:56:43,900
-嗯？
-上周那台迈凯伦梅赛德斯，1分20秒9。
-Yes?
-The McLaren Mercedes
from last week, 120.9.

1079
00:56:43,933 --> 00:56:44,967
那肯定跑不过它了。
It's not gonna beat that.

1080
00:56:45,067 --> 00:56:46,467
毕竟那些可都是实打实的重磅狠角色。
These are the big
heavyweights.

1081
00:56:46,500 --> 00:56:49,600
好，来看看兰博基尼 Murcielago，
1分23秒7，
Okay, we've got
the Lamborghini Murcielago,
123.7,

1082
00:56:49,633 --> 00:56:53,067
Zonda，1分23秒8，
柯尼塞格，1分23秒9。
Zonda, 123.8,
Koenigsegg, 123.9.

1083
00:56:53,067 --> 00:56:58,067
-法拉利 CS，1分22秒3。
-不会吧，这也太……
-Ferrari CS, 122.3.
-No. That is...

1084
00:56:58,067 --> 00:57:01,300
-（观众欢呼）
-快得不可思议！
-(AUDIENCE CHEERS)
-Unbelievably fast.

1085
00:57:01,333 --> 00:57:02,933
这简直……
That is...

1086
00:57:06,133 --> 00:57:09,333
这速度绝了。
行吧。
That is some going.
Okay.

1087
00:57:09,367 --> 00:57:12,300
那说到保时捷，
在性能方面
So to the Porsche,
you couldn't find
any difference

1088
00:57:12,333 --> 00:57:13,933
你根本挑不出它俩有啥差别，对吧？
between them in terms
of performance, all right?

1089
00:57:13,967 --> 00:57:17,500
那就看看斯提格能不能分出高下了。
走着！
So let's see if the Stig can.
Here we go.

1090
00:57:17,533 --> 00:57:18,967
-哈蒙德：
起跑了！
-（轮胎尖叫声）
-HAMMOND:
Away he goes.
-(TYRES SQUEALING)

1091
00:57:19,067 --> 00:57:20,700
记住，这台车可没什么花哨的电子设备，
Now there's no fancy
electronics here, remember,

1092
00:57:20,733 --> 00:57:23,600
全靠发动机后置
带来的天然机械抓地力。
just the natural traction
of having the engine
right at the back.

1093
00:57:23,633 --> 00:57:28,333
杀进一号弯看着就快得飞起，
轮胎尖叫连连。
Already looking mighty
fast into the first corner.
Plenty of tyre squeal.

1094
00:57:28,367 --> 00:57:31,267
噢，要的就是这种感觉，
一台纯粹又原始的纯机械战车。
Oh, this is what
it's all about,
just a raw, simple car.

1095
00:57:31,300 --> 00:57:34,500
配上一个疯狂试探极限的纯粹车手。
And a raw, simple driver
right on the edge.

1096
00:57:36,300 --> 00:57:41,767
穿过芝加哥弯，
动作行云流水，
车尾被收拾得服服帖帖。
Through Chicago,
this is very smooth,
the tail kept nicely in check.

1097
00:57:41,800 --> 00:57:44,967
马上要进锤头弯了，
911 车头负重极轻，
Hammerhead is coming up,
now the 911 has so little
weight over the front,

1098
00:57:45,067 --> 00:57:49,067
按说可能会推头，
但他没有，
他直接把车尾甩起来了！
it might under-steer,
but it doesn't,
he's got the tail out.

1099
00:57:50,567 --> 00:57:52,300
现在进穿杨弯……
Now Follow Through...

1100
00:57:52,333 --> 00:57:55,367
入弯前收了下油，
但保时捷贴地姿态依旧稳如泰山。
Lifts off on the approach,
but the Porsche stays
perfectly planted.

1101
00:57:55,400 --> 00:57:58,067
这就是老派机械硬实力的魅力。
That is old-fashioned
mechanical grit for you.

1102
00:57:58,100 --> 00:58:02,367
奔向终点了，别忘了，911 想刷掉
360 的成绩可是一场硬仗。
Towards the finish, the 911's
got a hell of a job, remember,
to beat the 360's time.

1103
00:58:02,400 --> 00:58:04,767
冲向最后一个弯……
Up to the last bend...

1104
00:58:04,800 --> 00:58:08,767
他在那儿带了一点飘移。
冲线成绩是……
He's got a bit
of a drift on there.
And across the line in...

1105
00:58:08,800 --> 00:58:11,433
说出来你可能都不信？
1分……
You might not believe this?
One minute...

1106
00:58:11,467 --> 00:58:14,800
-法拉利跑的是 1分22秒3。
-要刷掉的目标，没错。
-It's 1.22.3
for the Ferrari then.
-To beat, yeah.

1107
00:58:14,833 --> 00:58:19,400
1分22秒3，
居然一模一样！
1.22.3,
it's exactly the same!

1108
00:58:19,433 --> 00:58:21,100
（观众欢呼）
(AUDIENCE CHEERS)

1109
00:58:25,000 --> 00:58:26,500
克拉克森：还有……
CLARKSON: And...

1110
00:58:27,567 --> 00:58:29,400
下周……
And next week...

1111
00:58:29,433 --> 00:58:33,400
下周，这玩意儿的亲大哥要登场了，
Carrera GT。
Next week, we've got
this thing's big brother
coming down, the Carrera GT.

1112
00:58:33,433 --> 00:58:36,433
我都等不及了。
下周见，晚安！
I cannot wait for that.
See you then. Good night.

1113
